    "Domestic CDN / platform domains that the upstream geosite-cn set misses.",
    "Symptom when they are missing: a domestic site loads through the overseas",
    "node and feels slow, and the user reports it as 'the node is slow' — the",
    "node is fine, the traffic simply should never have left the country.",
    "Keep this list short and evidence-based: add a suffix only after seeing it",
    "take the proxy path in the client log. Consumed by scripts/build_profile.py",
    "as an inline rule-set (never downloaded at runtime)."
